  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato, carrot and beetroot into bite-sized chunks.\n• Slice brown onion into thin wedges.\n• Spread potato, carrot and beetroot over a large microwave-safe plate. Cover with a damp paper towel. Microwave veggies on high, 3 minutes.\n• Drain, then place veggies and onion on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Spread out evenly, then roast until golden and tender, 12-15 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-647ea71bb94f6bf08ba06ca5-d59d399b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water.\n• Roughly chop walnuts.\n• When veggies have 5 minutes remaining, drain haloumi.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Reduce heat to medium. Add the honey and mixed sesame seeds and cook, turning haloumi, until fragrant and coated, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-647ea71bb94f6bf08ba06ca5-ae08b647.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the tray with the roasted veggies, add baby spinach leaves and a drizzle of the white wine vinegar and olive oil.\n• Gently toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-647ea71bb94f6bf08ba06ca5-b84f1a0c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roast veggie toss between bowls.\n• Top with honey sesame haloumi.\n• Sprinkle with walnuts and dollop with dill & parsley mayonnaise to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-647ea71bb94f6bf08ba06ca5-01d23f09.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
